flowchart TD
  mint["Start here: the owner runs<br/>claude setup-token once,<br/>outside any session"]:::start
  file[("Token file, mode 0600, one link<br/>settings: file, descriptorVariable, expires")]
  own[("Owner's own sign-in<br/>Keychain or .credentials.json")]
  script["Configuration script:<br/>tokenHandoffs in the selection"]
  ravel["Ravel CLI, after the selection:<br/>checks and reads the open file once"]
  subgraph confined["Ravel confinement: no grant and no skill source overlaps the token file"]
    claude["Claude Code reads the socket,<br/>closes it and removes the variable"]
    agent["Agent tools:<br/>no grant over the token file,<br/>no Keychain grant"]
  end
  mint -->|1. the owner saves the token| file
  script -->|2. names the handoff| ravel
  file -->|3. read for a confined launch| ravel
  ravel -->|4. token through a socket that the runner keeps open| claude
  claude -->|5. no token descriptor left| agent
  ravel -.->|never opened| own
  classDef start fill:#173451,color:#fff,stroke:#102a43,font-weight:bold
